{"pin":"BH10231","subcodes":[{"code":"BH10231","anchor":"","first_line":"Thou seest, O my God, how the wrongs committed by such of Thy creatures as have turned their backs to Thee","first_line_orig":"تری یا الهی کیف حال بین عبادک و مظهر نفسک ظلم المعرضین من خلقک ای رب فانزل  ","language":"Ara","word_count":"80","full_text_parts":["Thou seest, O my God, how the wrongs committed by such of Thy creatures as have turned their backs to Thee have come in between Him in Whom Thy Godhead is manifest and Thy servants.  Send down upon them, O my Lord, what will cause them to be busied with each others' concerns.  Let, then, their violence be confined to their own selves, that the land and they that dwell therein may find peace.\nOne of Thy handmaidens, O my Lord, hath sought Thy face, and soared in the atmosphere of Thy pleasure.  Withhold not from her, O my Lord, the things Thou didst ordain for the chosen ones among Thy handmaidens.\nEnable her, then, to be so attracted by Thine utterances that she will celebrate Thy praise amongst them.\n\nPotent art Thou to do what pleaseth Thee.  No God is there but Thee, the Almighty, Whose help is implored by all men."],"translations":[{"language":"es","lang_name":"Spanish"},{"language":"bg","lang_name":"Bulgarian"},{"language":"bs","lang_name":"Bosnian"},{"language":"ro","lang_name":"Romanian"},{"language":"uk","lang_name":"Ukrainian"},{"language":"hy","lang_name":"Armenian"},{"language":"ja","lang_name":"Japanese"},{"language":"pt","lang_name":"Portuguese"},{"language":"fa","lang_name":"Persian"},{"language":"pl","lang_name":"Polish"},{"language":"ca","lang_name":"Catalan"},{"language":"en","lang_name":"English"},{"language":"el","lang_name":"Greek"},{"language":"ht","lang_name":"Haitian Creole"},{"language":"de","lang_name":"German"},{"language":"sk","lang_name":"Slovak"},{"language":"nl","lang_name":"Dutch"},{"language":"tvl","lang_name":"Tuvalu"}],"writing_refs":[{"type":"pm","type_name":"Prayers \u0026 Meditations","language":"ja","lang_name":"Japanese"},{"type":"pm","type_name":"Prayers \u0026 Meditations","language":"ro","lang_name":"Romanian"},{"type":"pm","type_name":"Prayers \u0026 Meditations","language":"bs","lang_name":"Bosnian"},{"type":"pm","type_name":"Prayers \u0026 Meditations","language":"el","lang_name":"Greek"},{"type":"pm","type_name":"Prayers \u0026 Meditations","language":"hy","lang_name":"Armenian"},{"type":"pm","type_name":"Prayers \u0026 Meditations","language":"fa","lang_name":"Persian"},{"type":"pm","type_name":"Prayers \u0026 Meditations","language":"uk","lang_name":"Ukrainian"},{"type":"pm","type_name":"Prayers \u0026 Meditations","language":"sk","lang_name":"Slovak"},{"type":"pm","type_name":"Prayers \u0026 Meditations","language":"ht","lang_name":"Haitian Creole"},{"type":"pm","type_name":"Prayers \u0026 Meditations","language":"en","lang_name":"English"},{"type":"pm","type_name":"Prayers \u0026 Meditations","language":"tvl","lang_name":"Tuvalu"},{"type":"pm","type_name":"Prayers \u0026 Meditations","language":"orig","lang_name":"Original"},{"type":"pm","type_name":"Prayers \u0026 Meditations","language":"pl","lang_name":"Polish"},{"type":"pm","type_name":"Prayers \u0026 Meditations","language":"nl","lang_name":"Dutch"},{"type":"pm","type_name":"Prayers \u0026 Meditations","language":"pt","lang_name":"Portuguese"},{"type":"pm","type_name":"Prayers \u0026 Meditations","language":"bg","lang_name":"Bulgarian"},{"type":"pm","type_name":"Prayers \u0026 Meditations","language":"it","lang_name":"Italian"},{"type":"pm","type_name":"Prayers \u0026 Meditations","language":"ca","lang_name":"Catalan"},{"type":"pm","type_name":"Prayers \u0026 Meditations","language":"ar","lang_name":"Arabic"},{"type":"pm","type_name":"Prayers \u0026 Meditations","language":"es","lang_name":"Spanish"},{"type":"pm","type_name":"Prayers \u0026 Meditations","language":"de","lang_name":"German"}],"refs":[{"kind":"manuscript","code":"INBA92:353a","source":"INBA92","locator":"353a","url":"https://af